      en: ["Construction took place between 1513 and 1517", "The gallery spanning the Cher is 60 meters long", "The arched bridge was completed in 1559 by Diane de Poitiers", "Served as a military hospital during World War I", "The estate features a 1500 square meter yew maze", "Listed as a Monument historique by the French Ministry since 1840"],
